{"seq":2,"slug":"partitioning-strategies","title":"分区策略与再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/partitioning-strategies","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分区策略与再平衡\">分区策略与再平衡</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>分区（Partitioning，也称分片 Sharding）是将大型数据集拆分到多个节点上存储和处理的核心技术。当单节点无法承载数据量或查询负载时，分区是实现水平扩展的唯一路径。一个优秀的分区策略需要同时满足：数据均匀分布（避免热点）、查询高效路由（避免扇出）、以及平滑的再平衡（避免大规模数据迁移）。</p>\n<p>本文系统介绍分区的核心策略、热点处理方案和在线再平衡机制，帮助工程师设计高效的分布式数据架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"分区策略分类\">分区策略分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>范围查询</th>\n<th>负载均衡</th>\n<th>热点风险</th>\n<th>典型系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按键范围</td>\n<td>连续键范围映射到分区</td>\n<td>高效</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>HBase, Spanner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按哈希</td>\n<td>键的哈希值决定分区</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Cassandra, DynamoDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合分区</td>\n<td>复合键前缀范围+后缀哈希</td>\n<td>前缀范围有效</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Cassandra (复合主键)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录式</td>\n<td>中央目录维护键到分区映射</td>\n<td>取决于目录</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>早期 MongoDB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"按键范围分区\">按键范围分区</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"分区 1: [A, G)  → Node 1&#10;分区 2: [G, N)  → Node 2&#10;分区 3: [N, T)  → Node 3&#10;分区 4: [T, Z]  → Node 4&#10;&#10;优点: 范围查询高效 (扫描单分区或少数相邻分区)&#10;缺点: 时间序列键导致写入集中在最新分区 (热点)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>分区 1: [A, G)  → Node 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分区 2: [G, N)  → Node 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分区 3: [N, T)  → Node 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分区 4: [T, Z]  → Node 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优点: 范围查询高效 (扫描单分区或少数相邻分区)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 时间序列键导致写入集中在最新分区 (热点)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>热点示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 如果按时间戳分区，所有最新写入集中到一个分区&#10;key = &quot;2026-05-08T10:30:00_event_123&quot;  → 全部写入最新分区&#10;&#10;// 解决方案: 在时间戳前添加随机前缀&#10;key = &quot;shard_7_2026-05-08T10:30:00_event_123&quot;  → 分散到多个分区&#10;// 代价: 范围查询需要扇出到所有 shard_N 前缀\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果按时间戳分区，所有最新写入集中到一个分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>key = \"2026-05-08T10:30:00_event_123\"  → 全部写入最新分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 解决方案: 在时间戳前添加随机前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>key = \"shard_7_2026-05-08T10:30:00_event_123\"  → 分散到多个分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代价: 范围查询需要扇出到所有 shard_N 前缀</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"按哈希分区\">按哈希分区</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import hashlib&#10;&#10;def get_partition(key, num_partitions):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;一致性哈希示例&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    hash_value = int(hashlib.md5(key.encode()).hexdigest(), 16)&#10;    return hash_value % num_partitions&#10;&#10;# 均匀分布，但丢失了键的顺序关系&#10;get_partition(&quot;user_001&quot;, 16)  # → 分区 7&#10;get_partition(&quot;user_002&quot;, 16)  # → 分区 3&#10;get_partition(&quot;user_003&quot;, 16)  # → 分区 12\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_partition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, num_partitions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"一致性哈希示例\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hashlib.md5(key.encode()).hexdigest(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hash_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_partitions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 均匀分布，但丢失了键的顺序关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">get_partition(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 分区 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">get_partition(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 分区 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">get_partition(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_003\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 分区 12</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"一致性哈希与虚拟节点\">一致性哈希与虚拟节点</h3><p>传统哈希取模在分区数变化时需要大规模数据迁移。一致性哈希通过哈希环解决这个问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Hash Ring with Virtual Nodes&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;Node A: vn1, vn4, vn7&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;Node B: vn2, vn5, vn8&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;Node C: vn3, vn6, vn9&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Hash Ring with Virtual Nodes\"\n        A[\"Node A: vn1, vn4, vn7\"]\n        B[\"Node B: vn2, vn5, vn8\"]\n        C[\"Node C: vn3, vn6, vn9\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ConsistentHash:&#10;    def __init__(self, nodes, virtual_nodes=150):&#10;        self.ring = SortedDict()  # 有序字典&#10;        self.virtual_nodes = virtual_nodes&#10;        for node in nodes:&#10;            self._add_node(node)&#10;&#10;    def _add_node(self, node):&#10;        for i in range(self.virtual_nodes):&#10;            key = f&quot;{node}:vn{i}&quot;&#10;            hash_val = self._hash(key)&#10;            self.ring[hash_val] = node&#10;&#10;    def get_node(self, key):&#10;        hash_val = self._hash(key)&#10;        # 在环上顺时针找到第一个节点&#10;        idx = self.ring.bisect_right(hash_val)&#10;        if idx &gt;= len(self.ring):&#10;            idx = 0&#10;        return self.ring.values()[idx]&#10;&#10;    def _hash(self, key):&#10;        return int(hashlib.sha256(key.encode()).hexdigest(), 16)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConsistentHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, nodes, virtual_nodes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SortedDict()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 有序字典</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.virtual_nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> virtual_nodes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nodes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._add_node(node)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _add_node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.virtual_nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:vn</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            hash_val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._hash(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ring[hash_val] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hash_val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._hash(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 在环上顺时针找到第一个节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ring.bisect_right(hash_val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ring):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ring.values()[idx]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hashlib.sha256(key.encode()).hexdigest(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>虚拟节点的作用：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个物理节点映射多个虚拟节点（通常 100-200 个）</li>\n<li>保证数据在物理节点间均匀分布</li>\n<li>节点增删时仅影响相邻虚拟节点的数据（约 1/N 的数据迁移）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分区与二级索引\">分区与二级索引</h3><p>分区系统中的二级索引有两种实现方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>写入代价</th>\n<th>查询代价</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地索引 (Document-partitioned)</td>\n<td>每个分区维护自己的索引</td>\n<td>低 (只更新本地)</td>\n<td>高 (查询需扇出全部分区)</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局索引 (Term-partitioned)</td>\n<td>索引独立分区</td>\n<td>高 (跨分区更新索引)</td>\n<td>低 (直接定位目标分区)</td>\n<td>可能延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Local Index&quot;&#10;        P1[&quot;Partition 1: data + local index&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;Partition 2: data + local index&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;Partition 3: data + local index&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Q1[&quot;Query by secondary key&quot;] --&gt; P1&#10;    Q1 --&gt; P2&#10;    Q1 --&gt; P3\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Local Index\"\n        P1[\"Partition 1: data + local index\"]\n        P2[\"Partition 2: data + local index\"]\n        P3[\"Partition 3: data + local index\"]\n    end\n    Q1[\"Query by secondary key\"] --&gt; P1\n    Q1 --&gt; P2\n    Q1 --&gt; P3</pre><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"分区键设计实践\">分区键设计实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Cassandra: 复合分区键设计&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events (&#10;    user_id UUID,           -- 分区键第一部分&#10;    event_date DATE,        -- 分区键第二部分 (按日分区)&#10;    event_time TIMESTAMP,   -- 聚簇键 (分区内排序)&#10;    event_type TEXT,&#10;    payload TEXT,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY ((user_id, event_date), event_time)&#10;) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (event_time DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 查询 1: 高效 (精确定位单分区)&#10;SELECT * FROM user_events&#10;WHERE user_id = ? AND event_date = &#39;2026-05-08&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 查询 2: 需要扇出 (跨多个分区)&#10;SELECT * FROM user_events&#10;WHERE user_id = ?&#10;  AND event_date &gt;= &#39;2026-05-01&#39; AND event_date &lt;= &#39;2026-05-08&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Cassandra: 复合分区键设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id UUID,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区键第一部分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区键第二部分 (按日分区)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 聚簇键 (分区内排序)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type </span><span style=\"c