/span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rates) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hotspots </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid, rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rates.items()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hotspots</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> suggest_mitigation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, hotspot_pid):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"热点缓解建议\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'split'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Split partition </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hotspot_pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> into sub-ranges'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'salt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Add random prefix to distribute writes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Add read cache for hot partition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'rate_limit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Apply rate limiting per key'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"在线再平衡方案\">在线再平衡方案</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>数据迁移量</th>\n<th>停机时间</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定分区数</td>\n<td>预创建多于节点数的分区</td>\n<td>最小 (移动整个分区)</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态分裂</td>\n<td>分区过大时分裂</td>\n<td>中 (分裂+迁移)</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按节点固定分区数</td>\n<td>新节点加入时从现有节点偷取</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟节点再分配</td>\n<td>调整虚拟节点到物理节点映射</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>固定分区数（推荐方案）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"初始: 1024 个分区分配到 4 个节点 (每节点 256 个分区)&#10;扩容到 8 个节点: 每个旧节点转移 128 个分区到新节点&#10;最终: 每节点 128 个分区&#10;&#10;优点: 分区边界不变，无需重新哈希&#10;      迁移粒度为完整分区，逻辑简单&#10;缺点: 初始分区数需要规划好 (过少无法充分利用新节点)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>初始: 1024 个分区分配到 4 个节点 (每节点 256 个分区)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>扩容到 8 个节点: 每个旧节点转移 128 个分区到新节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最终: 每节点 128 个分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优点: 分区边界不变，无需重新哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      迁移粒度为完整分区，逻辑简单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 初始分区数需要规划好 (过少无法充分利用新节点)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"分区数规划\">分区数规划</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据规模</th>\n<th>建议分区数</th>\n<th>单分区大小</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 100GB</td>\n<td>16-64</td>\n<td>2-6GB</td>\n<td>管理开销低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100GB - 1TB</td>\n<td>64-256</td>\n<td>4-15GB</td>\n<td>平衡管理与并行度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1TB - 10TB</td>\n<td>256-1024</td>\n<td>10-40GB</td>\n<td>充分利用并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 10TB</td>\n<td>1024-4096</td>\n<td>10-50GB</td>\n<td>大规模分布式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"跨分区查询优化\">跨分区查询优化</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Scatter-Gather</strong>：并行查询所有分区，合并结果。适合聚合查询</li>\n<li><strong>路由表缓存</strong>：客户端缓存分区路由，避免每次查询经过协调器</li>\n<li><strong>协处理器（Coprocessor）</strong>：将计算下推到分区节点（HBase, TiKV）</li>\n<li><strong>物化视图</strong>：预计算跨分区的聚合结果，用空间换时间</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"避免分区倾斜\">避免分区倾斜</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>分析数据分布</strong>：上线前用生产数据样本验证分区键的均匀性</li>\n<li><strong>监控分区大小</strong>：设置告警，单分区超过阈值时触发分裂</li>\n<li><strong>避免单调递增键</strong>：自增 ID 作为分区键会导致写入集中</li>\n<li><strong>组合键策略</strong>：<code>(tenant_id, timestamp)</code> 既保证租户内有序又避免全局热点</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>分区方式</th>\n<th>再平衡</th>\n<th>特色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cassandra</td>\n<td>一致性哈希 + 虚拟节点</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>可调一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>范围/哈希分片</td>\n<td>自动均衡器</td>\n<td>Chunk 迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TiDB</td>\n<td>范围分区 (Region)</td>\n<td>自动分裂与调度 (PD)</td>\n<td>热点调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>范围分区</td>\n<td>自动分裂/合并/迁移</td>\n<td>地理感知分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vitess</td>\n<td>自定义分片函数</td>\n<td>VReplication</td>\n<td>MySQL 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB</td>\n<td>哈希分区</td>\n<td>自适应容量</td>\n<td>全托管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kafka</td>\n<td>固定分区数 + 哈希</td>\n<td>分区重分配</td>\n<td>消息分区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>分区策略的核心目标是在数据均匀分布、查询效率和运维复杂度之间取得平衡。哈希分区提供最佳的负载均衡但牺牲范围查询；键范围分区保留数据顺序但容易产生热点；组合分区结合两者优势但增加了设计复杂度。</p>\n<p>在 2026 年的实践中，多数分布式数据库采用范围分区 + 自动分裂的方式（如 TiDB、CockroachDB、Spanner），兼顾了范围查询的效率和自动再平衡的便利。工程师的核心决策点在于分区键的选择——它直接决定了数据分布的均匀性和查询的路由效率，是整个分布式数据架构中最关键的设计决策之一。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分区策略与再平衡","id":"分区策略与再平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"分区策略分类","id":"分区策略分类"},{"level":3,"text":"按键范围分区","id":"按键范围分区"},{"level":3,"text":"按哈希分区","id":"按哈希分区"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性哈希与虚拟节点","id":"一致性哈希与虚拟节点"},{"level":3,"text":"分区与二级索引","id":"分区与二级索引"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"分区键设计实践","id":"分区键设计实践"},{"level":3,"text":"热点检测与缓解","id":"热点检测与缓解"},{"level":3,"text":"在线再平衡方案","id":"在线再平衡方案"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"分区数规划","id":"分区数规划"},{"level":3,"text":"跨分区查询优化","id":"跨分区查询优化"},{"level":3,"text":"避免分区倾斜","id":"避免分区倾斜"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"主从复制与多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/replication-models"},"next":{"title":"复制一致性与共识算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/consistency-and-consensus"}}